\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":220885,"global_rank":192740},{"name":"dannykha/Auto-Ranging-Ohmmeter","owner":"dannykha","html_url":"https://github.com/dannykha/Auto-Ranging-Ohmmeter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Designed and built with love by Max Kelton and Danny Kha","topics":[],"score":220882,"global_rank":192760},{"name":"AsirAAlam/COP4520-Programming-Assignment-3","owner":"AsirAAlam","html_url":"https://github.com/AsirAAlam/COP4520-Programming-Assignment-3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"COP4520-Programming-Assignment-3","topics":[],"score":220882,"global_rank":192763},{"name":"WadeCappa/fc_centrality","owner":"WadeCappa","html_url":"https://github.com/WadeCappa/fc_centrality","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"An implementation of two flow-network centrality measures; flow-cost closeness and flow-cost betweeness.","topics":[],"score":220882,"global_rank":192779}]